    "text": "wcti12.com\nwebsite\nNew Bern\nOld Airport Road lane closure scheduled for July 31 and August 1 due to paving project\nBy News 12 Staff,\n3 hours agoThe City of New Bern is letting residents know that one lane of Old Airport Road will be closed on July 31 and Aug. 1 from 7:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. This closure extends from Taberna Way north to Sellhorn Blvd (the southbound lane will remain open). Motorists are advised to follow Taberna Way to access Hwy 70, and from Hwy 70 follow signs to W. Grantham Road to access the southern portion of Old Airport Road. Public Works will be milling & paving Old Airport at Taberna Way for an intersection improvement project, the City of New Bern says.",
